ement_acceptance_always + real_machine_usecases_not_unit_tests BEFORE any user-facing ReportDone—FORBID Brief/Closeout with 结论=已完成/通过 immediately after Write without Accept/真机 UC|WB-OP (or formal e2e) evidence; 「通过即开发」does NOT mean 「开发完即可宣称完成」. Complements host_plan_mode_for_planning, plan_review_three_lenses, plan_review_requires_code_evidence, plan_review_requires_impact_surface, scheme_requires_architecture_review, plan_content_focus_only, requirement_acceptance_always, real_machine_usecases_not_unit_tests, user_facing_brief_plain_report. Dual-write host mirror: `~/.cursor/rules/plan-complete-self-review-then-implement.mdc` (global_rules_dual_write_mcp_and_host).',
