                'id' => 'css_js_theme_work_requires_custom_theme_skill',
                'summary' => 'MANDATORY for ANY storefront/admin CSS/JS/theme/layout/component/image work: BEFORE the first edit get_skill(custom_theme_development | weline-custom-theme-development) and Read app/code/Weline/Theme/doc/开发/自定义主题开发路线.md, then obey it. Core: skeleton before skin (版心 = --weline-layout-content-max-width + --weline-container-gutter only; FORBID calc(100%-Npx)/per-breakpoint gutters); token-only spacing/radius/font-size/color (FORBID bare px/hex/invented vars, var() fallbacks must be real leaves); brand palette+scale+skin MUST be listed in {area}/partials/head/theme-head-css-overlay.php (PACK_TOKENS whitelists default filenames only) and same-key assets/css/theme.css|theme.js override is FORBIDDEN; one responsive authority, literal @media (no var()), no JS matchMedia/innerWidth layout branching; images final WebP with retina ≤2×, longest edge ≤1600/≤2560, budgets content ≤200KB, thumb ≤80KB, theme banner target 70–120KB, hero ≤350KB, icon ≤30KB, explicit width/height or aspect-ratio, placeholder via StorefrontImagePlaceholder SVG (FORBID data:), theme assets under /static/{Vendor}/{theme}/{area}/assets/images/ with 200 verified; JS: weline.js loader only (Weline.declare/load, data-weline-load|declare|mount, Weline.dom.observe), theme JS via <theme:js>, browser I/O only Weline.Api.* (FORBID fetch/XHR/axios); acceptance on NEW local website (~site/{code}) + w_fpc_pierce, and _wb_nc on every URL after a CSS/JS/template change, reporting 1440/1024/390 scrollWidth==innerWidth, measured contrast ≥4.5:1, broken images 0. Complements css_or_theme_requires_ui_prototype_theme_skills, theme_engineer_for_theme_work, custom_theme_acceptance_new_local_website, web_images_webp_compressed, weline_js_loader_framework_only.',
