                'id' => 'theme_default_forbids_css_important',
                'summary' => 'HARD ABSTRACT cascade contract for the DEFAULT theme layer (work_mode=default_theme; app/code/Weline/Theme/view/theme/** and default-layer Theme static CSS consumed as parent baseline): FORBID writing `!important` on visual/layout/presentation declarations in source CSS, `<style>` blocks, or inline style that design themes must be able to override—including `var(--token) !important` (Token leaves alone force palette changes; !important is the wrong lever). Default theme MUST win via normal cascade—selector specificity, source order, Token leaves. NARROW UA/a11y EXCEPTIONS ONLY: (1) `[hidden]` → `display: none !important`; (2) `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` shortening motion. FORBID inventing other exceptions. Historical debt: Mode A cleanup; do not expand. Complements theme_design_must_inherit_not_mutate_source_widgets. Authority: theme-css-variables-only.md; Theme开发总指南.md; 主题开发.md Mode A cascade process.',
