                'id' => 'documentation_engineer_for_docs_work',
                'summary' => 'MANDATORY for complex engineering-team work that changes product behavior, module contracts, or user-visible behavior (default: any construction-closed coding ask)—OR when the user asks 文档同步 / 文档漂移 / 文档工程师 / 三文档对齐—OR when any durable module documentation needs create/update (三文档/README/guides/API·architecture docs/durable spec updates). Staff core seat 文档工程师 (Team:文档工程师:; alias 文档) as a real subagent. UNIFIED AUTHORSHIP (documentation_engineer_owns_durable_docs): ONLY 文档工程师 may write/update durable owning-module docs under app/code/*/doc/—FORBID backend/frontend/API/event/widget/theme/payment/analytics (and other construction/specialty seats) from privately editing those durable files. Other seats MUST hand off via doc_debt (behavior summary + suggested doc paths) + notify_pm + suggested_seats including 文档工程师; PM MUST same-turn arrange/resume 文档工程师 to write. Role MUST keep docs in lockstep with verified implementation: when code changes, corresponding durable documentation descriptions MUST change—FORBID claiming done while docs still describe old behavior/APIs/config/acceptance. HARD gate order: after tester_execution_pass and BEFORE pm_huishen_pass run documentation_review_pass; construction waves MUST NOT block coding but MUST leave doc_debt (not write module doc/); FORBID pm_huishen_pass / user completion without meetings/文档-review.md=pass (or SESSION N/A + rationale≥24 for pure prompt/no-behavior waves). Evidence: paths_changed + tester evidence + contracts/UC + doc_debt. Exceptions: 需求分析 first-time clarify write of doc/开发/spec/{slug}.md; 提示词优化工程师 edits to dev/ai-command/seat mirrors/hard-rule wording; SESSION/team/channel/meetings non-module artifacts. FORBID rewriting production code under guise of docs; blocked → findings_wake_pm. HARD: get_skill(documentation_engineer|weline-documentation-engineer) and Read 文档工程师.md + 工程团队.md. Complements docs_reconcile_on_closeout, module_doc_forbids_ephemeral_work_artifacts, ui_prototype_gate_before_test, closeout_requires_huishen; content-ops exempt. 监工 mode: parent carries the same unify-write duty without Team: prefix.',
