            [
                'id' => 'plan_content_focus_only',
                'summary' => 'MANDATORY for every engineering plan body (Plan Mode create_plan / repository-root `dev/session/{slug}.md` plan notes / user-facing architecture plan—FORBID module `doc/开发/plan.md` per module_doc_forbids_ephemeral_work_artifacts): write ONLY three focused sections—(1) 背景: why this ask and the current gap for THIS topic; (2) 方案: what to do and the chosen approach (mechanism/owning_module/reuse/not_to_do as compact bullets); (3) 细节: concrete how-to steps, chapter/dev_tasks, files/paths, and acceptance how. FORBID topic drift and padding: process-catalog essays, unrelated module tours, motivational fluff, restating the whole MCP workflow, parallel feature pitches, decorative overviews that do not change the build, or long narrative that re-explains hard rules already in hard_constraints. Keep required structured fields (requirements, architecture_design keys, acceptance) as short bullets under those three sections—do not invent extra “愿景/价值主张/行业背景” chapters. 细节 MUST carry plan_implementability_checklist bullets as short lists under the three shells—FORBID inventing top-level 阶段一～七 chapters. Complements host_plan_mode_for_planning + plan_implementability_checklist; does NOT waive architecture_design_structured, acceptance planning, or plan compliance dimensions. Host alwaysApply mirror: `~/.cursor/rules/plan-implementability-checklist.mdc` (see global_rules_dual_write_mcp_and_host).',
                'doc' => self::AUTHORITATIVE_WORKFLOW_DOC,
            ],
            [
                'id' => 'plan_implementability_checklist',
                'summary' => 'MANDATORY HARD for every engineering plan body (Plan Mode / `dev/session/{slug}.md` / host-authored 背景+方案+细节)—keeps plan_content_focus_only THREE shells only; FORBID enterprise SDLC 阶段一～七 / 1～24 as top-level plan chapters. Under 细节 (and compact bullets under 背景/方案 when named), complex/team plans MUST include short implementability bullets: feasibility; nfr_or_na (or nfr_na_rationale≥24); lld_or_na (schema/API/sequence when in scope else N/A≥24); env_ci (local `*.test.weline.com` + `php bin/w e2e:run`/contract cmds—FORBID inventing Jenkins/Confluence/budget/Sponsor rituals); milestones_or_na (align-freeze/code-freeze/test/release when complex); release_rollback_or_na (only when production/Deploy in scope); plus existing paths/dev_tasks/acceptance/real-machine UCs. Simple/监工 MAY use one implementability_simple_skip≥24 covering feasibility/nfr/lld/milestones/release_rollback cluster—still MUST keep paths+dev_tasks+acceptance (+真机 UC when behavior changes). Self-review (plan_complete_self_review_then_implement engineering lens) MUST fail 不通过 when required bullets missing—Agent MAY fill then re-review; FORBID construction start while incomplete; FORBID binding checklist fail to align-freeze pass (align-freeze = UC+contracts+deps only). Chat stays user_facing_brief_plain_report—checklist lives in plan/SESSION, not default chat dumps. Map doc: `app/code/Weline/Ai/doc/规则/计划可实施清单.md`. Complements plan_content_focus_only, plan_complete_self_review_then_implement, real_machine_usecases_not_unit_tests. Host alwaysApply mirror: `~/.cursor/rules/plan-implementability-checklist.mdc` (global_rules_dual_write_mcp_and_host).',
