            [
                'id' => 'storefront_internal_url_via_url_helper',
                'summary' => 'MANDATORY【禁止拼接】In-site navigations (href/action/data-*-url, storefront JSON links) MUST be generated by the Url module or url tags—never string-concatenated. Frontend templates: prefer @url/@frontend-url/@backend-url (or <url>/<frontend-url>/<backend-url>); PHP data-prep may use $this->getUrl family. Backend Service/Query/Controller: prefer Weline\\Framework\\Http\\Url::getUrl / getFrontendUrl / getBackendUrl (thin wrappers OK only if they call these). FORBIDDEN: \'/\'.$path, hardcoded /module/action, Url::getPrefix().$path (getPrefix is locale/currency only—omits website mounts like /daocharms), mount+slug splice. External http(s) may stay as-is. Authoritative: Framework 06-url标签使用指南.md.',
