                'summary' => 'Controller get*/post*/put*/delete* prefixes are HTTP verbs only; when a UI page Controller exists, URL actions must be page verbs such as edit/add/view — never /getEdit or /postSave. Data save/delete/mutate MUST NOT be new Controller actions—use async BinQuery (ui_page_controllers_mutations_via_async_binquery).',
