            [
                'id' => 'website_concept_seed_not_in_modules',
                'summary' => 'SERIOUS ERROR / MANDATORY CONTEXT-CARRIED (ABSTRACT): Framework modules under app/code/ are domain kernels—NOT a dump for website/theme/brand openers OR site-specific storefront copy. FORBIDDEN in any module: (1) seed scripts/data/Seeder classes bound to a specific website code, design theme, merchant brand, or storefront catalog matrix (category trees, SKU shelves, import/mount openers, site Sample kits); (2) per-site/theme/brand user-visible copy as module defaults—i18n/*.csv entries, default widget/layout/template strings, brand-identity seed fallbacks, SEO/FAQ ledes that name one vertical/brand. This is NOT a denylist of named sites—EVERY current and future website/theme MUST obey. HOME: app/design/{Vendor}/{theme}/ (versioned overlays: templates, widget/layout defaults, data|scripts) or websites/<site>/ (ops vault); site-specific translations belong on design theme layout/widget Meta i18n (ThemeScopedI18nProjector / MetaLocal) or design template overlays—NOT module CSV as the brand default. Modules MAY expose generic Mutation/Repository APIs that design themes call; modules MUST NOT embed per-site ITEMS, per-theme openers, or brand policy copy. ALLOWED in modules: global domain defaults with no website/theme gate (Tax/Shipping seed-defaults, Setup/Install schema, system EAV) and neutral ecommerce phrasing. SCALE: N sites ⇒ N theme/vault packages—never N copies inside Product/Blog/Shipping/Theme/etc. Complements runtime_orchestrator_no_business_hardcode. Authoritative: Ai/doc/规则/30-后端与数据.md §6.2.',
                'doc' => 'app/code/Weline/Ai/doc/规则/30-后端与数据.md',
            ],
            [
                'id' => 'code_review_for_module_boundary',
                'summary' => 'MANDATORY for independent PR/diff code-review waves OR complex-team P4 process seat 代码复审 OR when diff under app/code suspects website/theme/brand openers (site-code gates, CatalogSeeder/Sample kits, brand default fallbacks, base Theme default homepage brandification). Staff ops-shell seat 代码复审 (Team:代码复审:; plugin eng-code-review) as a real subagent. HARD: get_skill(code_review|weline-code-review) and Read 代码复审.md + module-boundary-contamination.md BEFORE verdict. Process adapts awesome-skills/code-review-skill (four-phase + severity labels); technical verdicts ONLY from Weline hard_constraints / 扩展点选型 / 开发标准—FORBID upstream React/Vue/Clean-Architecture preferences vetoing documented Weline mechanisms. HARD module-boundary gate: EVERY review MUST run website_concept_seed_not_in_modules checklist; hits → module_boundary=fail + blocking (no pass). Read-only: FORBID rewriting production code under review guise. Write meetings/代码复审-review.md; fail → findings_wake_pm escalate @项目经理：请立刻组队解决. Content-ops execution exempt unless user asks contamination audit. Complements website_concept_seed_not_in_modules, engineering_team_for_new_requirements, plan_review_requires_code_evidence.',
