            [
                'id' => 'docs_reconcile_on_closeout',
                'summary' => 'After each feature, reconcile owning module doc/ with shipped behavior before claiming done. On complex engineering-team behavior/contract changes this MUST be executed by core seat 文档工程师 (Team:文档工程师:; alias 文档) via documentation_review_pass after tester_execution_pass and before pm_huishen_pass—implementation changes REQUIRE matching durable doc description updates (meetings/文档-review.md=pass or legal N/A≥24). Complements documentation_engineer_for_docs_work and module_doc_forbids_ephemeral_work_artifacts.',
