            [
                'id' => 'learning_rule_extraction_must_be_abstract',
                'summary' => 'MANDATORY HARD for every session-learning / knowledge extraction / reusable_rule mint (Agent, Codex extractor, OpenAI extractor, learningctl promotion, dual-write into hard_constraints or ~/.cursor/rules): the RULE body MUST be an ABSTRACT mechanism reusable across a class of cases—NOT a special case. PRIMARY meaning of 具体当规则: elevating one special case into the rule itself—e.g. one widget’s CSS/layout, one page’s markup, one Provider’s quirk, one site/theme name, one absolute path—FORBID writing that special case as reusable_rule. Special cases are EXAMPLES ONLY (positive_example / negative_example / short title). Correct: abstract reusable_rule (“部件外观样式须走主题 Token / 继承，禁止把单部件私有 CSS 升格为全局硬规则”) + example naming the concrete widget CSS. Also FORBID reusable_rule equals title/example, raw chat/question paste, or “Verify this user-reported…” wrappers as the rule. See website_concept_seed_not_in_modules / theme_mechanism_not_foreign_content (“登录仅为举例”). Complements session_learning_knowledge_conflict_gate and global_rules_dual_write_mcp_and_host. Host alwaysApply mirror: `~/.cursor/rules/learning-rule-extraction-abstract.mdc`.',
                'doc' => 'app/code/Weline/Ai/doc/规则/00-MCP调用与会话.md',
            ],
            [
                'id' => 'theme_design_multi_path_is_inheritance_normal',
                'summary' => 'HARD ABSTRACT: Under a design theme root app/design/{Vendor}/{theme}/, the same logical asset MAY appear at more than one on-disk path—modern {area}/… authoring, compat theme/{area}/… or view/theme/{area}/…, and theme:upgrade publish dual-write into that design tree’s Weline/Theme/view/theme URL namespace. This is theme inheritance + publish layout, NOT accidental duplicate/drift. FORBID reporting those sibling paths as architecture smell, “multi-copy bug”, or cleanup that deletes one side of a live design theme. Author edits under work_mode=design_theme go to the design theme authoritative area path; republish with theme:upgrade. Distinct from true defects (e.g. theme skin parked under an unrelated app/code module templates/ tree with no theme register). Complements theme_design_must_inherit_not_mutate_source_widgets. Host alwaysApply mirror: `~/.cursor/rules/theme-design-multi-path-inheritance-normal.mdc`. Authority: theme-inheritance-and-file-conventions.md; 规则/20 §7.',
                'doc' => 'app/code/Weline/Theme/doc/theme-inheritance-and-file-conventions.md',
